        "description": "Pass --output <path> to save the file bytes. md, docx and pdf require a doc; xlsx requires a sheet (409 unsupported_doc_type otherwise). An unknown format returns 400 invalid_format. Markdown and DOCX exports embed time-limited signed attachment links.",
